{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57203","headline":"十四科头 解缚不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 解缚不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"律师持律自缚，自缚亦能缚他。\n外作威仪恬静，心内恰似洪波。\n不驾生死船筏，如何度得爱河？\n不解真宗正理，邪见言辞繁多。\n有二比丘犯律，便却往问优波。\n优波依律说罪，转增比丘网罗。\n方丈室中居士，维摩便即来呵。\n优波默然无对，净名说法无过。\n而彼戒性如空，不在内外娑婆。\n劝除生灭不肯，忽悟还同释迦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}